 more videos come in. The first is from Dmitry Ermakov, who voiced many of the game’s characters.And if you happen to speak Spanish, here’s a hello from Ángel Nacar, one of our Spanish voice actors.Lorena M. Portalés, the voice of the witch Catalina de V","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T11:20:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689779","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3953700-1843481262692793","game_id":"steam-3953700","kind":"announcement","title":"Burn the Witch or Set Her Free? Your First Moral Choice","summary":"Moral choices and branching paths have always been my favorite things in games. A shout-out to all The Succession of Changing Kings fans! I especially appreciate it when decisions truly affect what happens, rather than creating a carefully scripted illusion of choice.In Your Judgment, Inquisitor, you’ll make one of the key decisions during the tutorial. Choose a different path on your next playthrough, and some events will unfold in an entirely different way.And here’s the choice itself:The demo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T16:39:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262692793","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3953700-1840310314338648","game_id":"steam-3953700","kind":"announcement","title":"Q&A and New Artwork","summary":"Another month has passed, and as usual, I’m sharing some new artwork and answering a few of your questions.Will it be possible to play as a good inquisitor? I hope you’ve heard of the Black Legend.Yes, you’ll have a great deal of freedom, and you can complete the entire game without sending a single person to the stake. The final outcome will therefore be entirely on your conscience. However, I want to emphasize once again that, despite its historical setting, the game is not intended as a faith","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-05T09:09:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314338648","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3953700-1834602721188505","game_id":"steam-3953700","kind":"announcement","title":"New demon, drawings from Rufina, and answers to your questions","summary":"A big inquisitorial hello to everyone!It has been a little over a month since our last post, so it is time to share some news and answer a few questions that have been coming up.First of all: development is going according to plan. This October, during the demo festival, you will be able to step into the role of an inquisitor yourselves.We also have another piece of good news: the game has started attracting attention from the Spanish press. Yesterday, journalist Bernardo Álvarez-Villar came to ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-04T18:53:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721188505","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3953700-1830163047268176","game_id":"steam-3953700","kind":"announcement","title":"A rabbi, a monk, and a bard walk into a cider house...","summary":"Over the past couple of weeks, we’ve received many questions on X, Reddit, and via email, and we think now is the perfect time to answer them and show some of Rufina’s work.Why did Asturias become the setting of the game?Asturias is located in the far north of Spain and is a very special place both historically and culturally. This is where the Reconquista began. At the same time, outside of Spain the region is not widely known.The game is being developed by two people, and we both live here. I ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-21T10:44:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047268176","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3953700-1826992588590386","game_id":"steam-3953700","kind":"announcement","title":"About the locations in the game","summary":"Danger awaits the inquisitor at every step. If you start condemning every parishioner to an auto-da-fé without discrimination, the pious Christians might hang you right on the gates of the cathedral. And if you show excessive piety, you may find yourself facing a church tribunal. May God protect you from the wrath of Torquemada.However, today I will show you a number of places that are no less dangerous. Places where demons dwell.After finishing your duties in the monastery, each turn you return","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-11T15:48:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826992588590386","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3953700-1825093633185329","game_id":"steam-3953700","kind":"announcement","title":"Greek Language, a Demon, and Q&A","summary":"Your Judgment, Inquisitor is approaching the coveted milestone of 10000 wishlists, an incredible result for a two-person team, a Russian and a Ukrainian. And there are still 10 months to go before release!Unexpectedly for us, a noticeable share of wishlists is coming from Greece (650+). Naturally, we couldn’t ignore that, the game will definitely be released in Greek as well.\\A fun but useless fact: one of the developers’ mother speaks Greek at about a B2 level. After the collapse of the USSR, s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-19T15:23:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825093633185329","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3953700-1823825466499470","game_id":"steam-3953700","kind":"announcement","title":"2 rooms, a demon, and an artist","summary":"As part of your inquisitorial service, you will also have to deal with exorcism. Each turn, the player chooses one of three locations. A demon may be hiding in each of them — or there may be none at all. You will have to determine this by collecting clues inside the location and by carefully listening to what is said in the monastery and during confession. Such information often provides important leads for reflection.A location usually consists of 3–5 rooms filled with various clues. Some of th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-06T12:23:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1823825466499470","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3953700-1821922921816849","game_id":"steam-3953700","kind":"announcement","title":"Q&A: January 16, 2025","summary":"The game has crossed the 6,000 wishlists mark. This feels like a good reason to publicly answer some of the questions you have been asking in our Telegram community and by email.We will make this a regular format, so if you have something to ask, feel free. I genuinely enjoy answering questions, even without the sacred Inquisition resorting to torture.Q. Is this your first game?A. No. I previously released The Succession of Changing Kings, a decision-making game set in a medieval kingdom. It cur","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-16T